<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-KALNAPILIS PROFIT, SALES UP IN H1 97.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-KALNAPILIS PROFIT, SALES UP IN H1 97.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's Kalnapilis brewery said on Thursday that its profit before taxes rose to 14.56 million litas in the first half of the year from 4.14 million litas in the same period in 1996.</p>
</text>
